            <ArticleTitle>Managing herpes zoster in older adults: Prescribing considerations.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>24-29</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1097/01.NPR.0000516122.15244.0e</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>NPs must be aware of special prescribing considerations for medication safety when managing the care of older adults with herpes zoster. Age-related physiologic changes of the body impact the pharmacokinetics and pharmacodynamics of antiviral and pain medications and can lead to potential adverse events.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
